  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P><STRONG>Stuart Price</STRONG> is busy working with <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> in the recording studio for her new album.</P>
<P>Tomorrow, <STRONG>Saturday&nbsp;9th April</STRONG>, he will play live at&nbsp;<STRONG>The Cross</STRONG> in <STRONG>London</STRONG> during their <STRONG>Type</STRONG> night. </P>
<P>We suggest our readers from London and the neighbourhood to be there.</P>
