<P align=justify>A day after<STRONG> Madonna</STRONG>'s papal debacle – she got in costume with hubby <STRONG>Guy Ritchie</STRONG> as a nun and pope for a <STRONG>London Purim party</STRONG> – the singer (with her makeup man) plays dress up on Good Friday in something more fitting: a glamorous gown for a music video shoot in London.</P>
