  <tr height="1">
    <td  background="images/riga.gif"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Today we are glad to&nbsp;introduce our brand new correspondent from <STRONG>Slovakia</STRONG>, <STRONG>Butki</STRONG>. Next days and weeks will be the turn of our new correspondents from other countries. If you want to join our family, <A href="mailto:share@drownedmadonna.com">contact us</A>. It doesn’t matter if we already have a correspondent from your country, if there’re not relevant news in your local media, if your country is small.</P>
<P><STRONG>Butki</STRONG> sent us a cutting from yesterday's edition of Slovakian newspaper Pravda. The article&nbsp;mentions <STRONG>Michael Savage</STRONG> bashing <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> in his own book <STRONG>"Liberalism Is A Mental Disorder"</STRONG>. So, after <STRONG>Elton John</STRONG> and <STRONG>Boy George</STRONG>, this is the turn of <STRONG>Savage</STRONG>.</P>
<P align=center><A href="/images/2005/slovakia/pravda5apr.jpg" target=_blank><IMG alt="click to enlarge" src="/images/2005/slovakia/pravda5apr_small.jpg" border=0></A></P>
<P align=justify>Here's the translation:</P>
<P align=justify><EM><STRONG>Madonna is a hypocrite</STRONG> <BR><BR><STRONG>Michael Savage</STRONG>, a famous American writer and a radio talkshow host, accused the singer&nbsp;of hypocrisy in his book <STRONG>"Liberalism Is A Mental Disorder“</STRONG>. <STRONG>Savage</STRONG> wrote that <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> is a woman who raised her career thanks to an indecent exposure and called her as <STRONG>a pseudo-pornographic belly dancer</STRONG>. According to him, <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> presents herself as a holy woman who had to leave <STRONG>America</STRONG> because she wanted to bicycle in <STRONG>England</STRONG>.&nbsp; "Her moronic friend <STRONG>Gwyneth Paltrow</STRONG> has done the same thing. They both fled <STRONG>America</STRONG> because <STRONG>America</STRONG> wasn’t clean enough for their children. <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> says that American people are intellectual bankrupt but she forgot to say that she involved it as well,“ adds <STRONG>Savage</STRONG>.</EM></P>
<P align=center><A href="mailto:share@drownedmadonna.com"><IMG src="/cor.jpg" border=0></A></P><img src="/corrispondenti/co-butki_slovakia.jpg" border="0">
</font></div>
	</td>
